
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.AdjustDamage(Number: number, Damage: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llAdjustDamage(integer Number, float Damage);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The llAdjustDamage modifies the amount of damage that will be applied by the current <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/On_damage" target="_blank">on_damage</a> event after it has completed processing.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Number / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/number" target="_blank">number</a></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>It's 1 based</span>The index of the damage event to be modified.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Damage / new_damage</td>
          <td>A new damage value to be applied or distributed after on_damage processing.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>combat</li>
        <li>detected</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">555</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-detected">Detected Event</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <p>This function allows a script to modify incoming damage before it is applied to an avatar or distributed by a task.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Calling this function from any event handler other than <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/On_damage" target="_blank">on_damage</a> results in an error message being shouted to the debug channel.
    <ul>
      <li>Requires the region to <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetEnv" target="_blank">allow damage adjustment</a> for the on_damage event to run</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
    <li>Negative indexes are not supported.</li>
    <li>Indexes that are out of range will silently fail.</li>
  </ul>
